<item>
            <title>[LU-20805] Client mount option handling</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20805</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;It appears a number of mount options are matched by prefix. For instance, &lt;tt&gt;nouser_xattr&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;nouser_fid2path&lt;/tt&gt; are eaten by &lt;tt&gt;nouser&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;sync_on_close&lt;/tt&gt; is eaten by &lt;tt&gt;sync&lt;/tt&gt;, &lt;tt&gt;device=&lt;/tt&gt; is eaten by &lt;tt&gt;dev&lt;/tt&gt;. None of these options reach Lustre.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
